{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00171",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.32,
      "end_seconds": 4.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Hmm, hello doctor, sorry, am I early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.84,
      "end_seconds": 10.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.51,
      "end_seconds": 13.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.38,
      "end_seconds": 17.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 18.71,
      "end_seconds": 22.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I mean, he's been having a routine check-up, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.53,
      "end_seconds": 28.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 28.73,
      "end_seconds": 34.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.66,
      "end_seconds": 40.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.84,
      "end_seconds": 49.87,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "As for occasional tiredness, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 50.44,
      "end_seconds": 52.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Mm, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.76,
      "end_seconds": 57.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.4,
      "end_seconds": 60.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.67,
      "end_seconds": 67.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain, persistent cough or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.6,
      "end_seconds": 80.95,
      "duration_seconds": 13.35,
      "text": "No, um, no chest pain, no persistent cough, no blood in the stool. I did have mild headaches now and then at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.36,
      "end_seconds": 87.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any shortness of breath, weight loss or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.66,
      "end_seconds": 93.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.59,
      "end_seconds": 97.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "So, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.36,
      "end_seconds": 99.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.47,
      "end_seconds": 103.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.99,
      "end_seconds": 104.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.46,
      "end_seconds": 120.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.03,
      "end_seconds": 126.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Yes, I had a hernia repair, about five years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.46,
      "end_seconds": 131.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.71,
      "end_seconds": 135.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I'm on rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, maybe, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.07,
      "end_seconds": 139.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Alright, do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.32,
      "end_seconds": 151.12,
      "duration_seconds": 10.8,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I, I take Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day. I'm on sodium valproate, 500 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 155.42,
      "end_seconds": 164.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.38,
      "text": "Yeah, doctor, I think the last prescription for the sodium valproate was 250 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.11,
      "end_seconds": 169.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.44,
      "end_seconds": 172.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "No, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.24,
      "end_seconds": 178.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.21,
      "end_seconds": 179.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.16,
      "end_seconds": 200.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.2,
      "end_seconds": 203.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Yes, aspirin, it gives me wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.64,
      "end_seconds": 218.98,
      "duration_seconds": 14.34,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.75,
      "end_seconds": 224.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.2,
      "end_seconds": 233.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.76,
      "end_seconds": 256.63,
      "duration_seconds": 21.87,
      "text": "High cholesterol, for five years. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I've had high blood pressure, yes. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. Okay, uh, so I've had diabetes, yes. I just want to get back to normal, really. I have epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.94,
      "end_seconds": 258.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.48,
      "end_seconds": 269.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "Okay, high cholesterol, that's already on your record. Good to know. Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.43,
      "end_seconds": 272.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 273.57,
      "end_seconds": 283.24,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temp 36.6 degrees, saturation 97 percent, pulse is 85 beats a minute, height 154 centimetres, weight 84 kilos, BP is 127 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.34,
      "end_seconds": 287.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.46,
      "end_seconds": 291.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.51,
      "end_seconds": 297.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.54,
      "end_seconds": 299.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.86,
      "end_seconds": 302.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.23,
      "end_seconds": 311.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with no tenderness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.62,
      "end_seconds": 313.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.23,
      "end_seconds": 316.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.04,
      "end_seconds": 336.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Heart and lung sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.21,
      "end_seconds": 345.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.26,
      "end_seconds": 351.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.21,
      "end_seconds": 361.89,
      "duration_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with generally well, nothing worrying today at this stage. I'd also keep a tendency towards high cholesterol in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.75,
      "end_seconds": 365.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "I'm just saving what we've covered so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.81,
      "end_seconds": 383.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Right, carry on. We should do blood tests for health screening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.44,
      "end_seconds": 387.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.83,
      "end_seconds": 391.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a lipid profile for health screening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.94,
      "end_seconds": 394.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.23,
      "end_seconds": 415.07,
      "duration_seconds": 18.84,
      "text": "Keep up regular exercise, around a hundred and fifty minutes a week, and go easy on processed food. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 419.6,
      "end_seconds": 420.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 422.25,
      "end_seconds": 428.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.41,
      "end_seconds": 429.11,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 430.05,
      "end_seconds": 437.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "Let's review you after the results are back. Right, just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 438.39,
      "end_seconds": 443.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 444.77,
      "end_seconds": 449.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 454.43,
      "end_seconds": 458.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Yeah, that's all, thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 459.22,
      "end_seconds": 459.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}